Maintainer: Jorge Luis Marmanillo Santana <jlmarmanillo@gmail.com>
Description: eduResearchR is an R data package that collects and organizes datasets
    related to education and educational research, sourced from various packages
    and repositories within the R ecosystem. The core objective is to provide
    users with a curated collection of educational data ready for statistical
    analysis immediately upon installation. This package is designed to assist
    students, researchers, and education professionals who require datasets to
    practice statistical analysis or conduct research. It facilitates direct
    work with data for descriptive analysis, correlations, regression, group
    comparison, hypothesis testing, data visualization, statistical modeling,
    and academic projects, including master's and doctoral theses. eduResearchR
    gathers selected educational datasets to streamline statistical analysis and
    educational research in R.
